        "Arundolyn",
        "Lion of Light"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Arundolyn: Arundolyn",
      "content": "Arundolyn, the Lion of Light, was Grand Master of the Knights of Favonius at the time of the cataclysm 500 years ago. He had no Vision and fought with a greatsword and longsword together. After the death of his friend Rostam he stopped fighting. His style is lost; Varka set out to recreate it and vowed to surpass him.\n\nItem texts show a boy from a line of knights who played with Rostam in the wolves' forest. As Grand Master he led the Knights against the monsters of the cataclysm. His title was a variant of Vennessa's Lionfang Knight title.",
