    "1": {
      "uid": 1,
      "key": [
        "Rostam",
        "Wolf Pup"
      ],
      "keysecondary": [
        "Arundolyn",
        "Lion of Light"
      ],
      "comment": "Arundolyn: Arundolyn and Rostam",
      "content": "Childhood friends and rivals, Arundolyn (the Lion) and Rostam (the Wolf Pup) were called sword and dagger. Rostam originated Favonius Bladework and died in the cataclysm after twenty-three years of service. Arundolyn gave up fighting afterwards.\n\nOn the eve of battle they drank together, one saying he would not mourn if the other failed to return and the other answering that he would toast him instead. Rostam's unsent letter to his disciple Roland stayed at the Knights' headquarters until, in 6.4, Varka laid it at the base of Roland's Black Sword in a vision, beside a small graveyard of swords that included Arundolyn's.",
      "constant": false,
      "vectorized": false,
