        "Varka",
        "dual-wield",
        "greatsword and longsword"
      ],
      "comment": "Arundolyn: Lion of Light's blade dance",
      "content": "Varka's Vision story says the Lion of Light wielded a claymore and a longsword together in a near-divine blade dance. Knights' records describe its fury but not its technique, so it faded. Varka set out to recreate it without drawing on his Vision, declaring he would surpass him.",
